{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2015 High-Speed Hack &amp; Slash \u00d7 Wave-Based Survival Action \u2015</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo version of <i>Rumble Burst</i>, you can experience the prologue story and play through the <strong>first stage</strong>. It\u2019s designed to let you try out the game\u2019s core mechanics and exhilarating combat in a short play session.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Included in the Demo</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prologue story cutscenes from the full version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One playable stage</strong>, featuring three selectable combat style modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave-based enemy progression and chain combo mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estimated playtime: <strong>15 minutes to 1 hour</strong>, depending on your playstyle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udeab <strong>Features Not Available in the Demo</strong> <i>(available in the full version)</i>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill currency system and some upgrade features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Costume switching</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score tracking (local leaderboard)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version includes multiple stages, a wider variety of skills and costumes, and plenty of replayable content.<br>Experience the thrill of <i>Rumble Burst</i>'s chain-combo action with this free demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The screenshots may include those from the full version of the game. Please note that some features are limited in the demo version.&quot;</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728250?t=1746733829","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728250?t=1746733829","capsule_image":"https://sha